# Route: guide 38 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to 57, 65
# quests, 2.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, Redridge Mountains, Teldrassil, Felwood, Ironforge): near
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Lakeshire -> Three
# Corners -> Lakeshire -> Lakeridge Highway -> Lakeshire -> Redridge Canyons
# -> Lakeshire -> Redridge Canyons -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Star, the Hand and the Heart
# (735; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44);
# An Ambassador of Evil (762; Ambassador Infernus 42).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), What
# Comes Around... (386), What Comes Around... (386), Songblade Search (95772),
# Songblade Search (95772), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls
# (1199), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps (971),
# Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The Lost
# Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
# (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential
# Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
# Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate
# of the Kingdom (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394),
# An Ancient Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms
# (96403), The Treaty of Understanding (98423).

